Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.23,0:00:10.94,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.94,0:00:14.71,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Nu-mi vine să cred că voi fi \Nrăpus de un glonț rătăcit...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.71,0:00:16.93,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Nu se poate să mori acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.10,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Cum rămâne cu visul tău?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.10,0:00:23.43,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Spuneai că ești Sagara Yoshiharu?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.43,0:00:26.60,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Visul meu de a avea un castel, \No țară și multe femei...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.38,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Du-l tu la bun sfârșit pentru mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.46,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Ce tot spui acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.44,0:00:33.47,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,O poți face, Yoshiharu!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.47,0:00:34.71,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Așteaptă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.71,0:00:37.29,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Nici măcar nu-ți știu numele!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.22,0:00:41.60,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Numele meu este \NKinoshita Toukichirou.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.44,0:00:43.48,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Toukichirou?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.82,0:00:46.48,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Tu ești Toyotomi Hideyoshi!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Nu muri!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.16,0:00:51.07,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Dacă mori acum, \Nistoria va fi dată peste cap!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.07,0:00:54.32,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Tu trebuie să-l servești pe \NNobunaga și să unificați Japonia!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.32,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Nobunaga?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.83,0:01:02.83,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Capul familiei Oda \Neste Oda... Nobuna.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.83,0:01:05.96,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.27,0:01:10.96,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Ce se întâmplă?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.84,0:01:17.93,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Înțeleg. E un vis!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.93,0:01:21.01,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sunt un mare fan al jocului \NAmbiția lordului Oda Nobunaga
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.01,0:01:23.66,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,și cred că am adormit \Nîn timp ce mă jucam.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.81,0:01:30.82,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,O-O fată?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.01,0:01:50.84,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.85,0:01:53.80,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,S-a zis cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.80,0:01:55.99,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.99,0:01:57.97,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Nu poți răni o fată așa drăguță!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.91,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Ar fi așa o pierdere!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.54,0:02:03.55,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Și tu ești un soldat al familiei Oda?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.55,0:02:06.18,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Ce naiba cauți aici fără o armă?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.18,0:02:07.19,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}La naiba.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.19,0:02:09.04,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu prea am gândit-o până la capăt.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.58,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,Omoară-i o dată!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.58,0:02:12.27,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Am înțeles!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.60,0:02:13.71,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trebuie să fac ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.71,0:02:15.28,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dacă nu...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.90,0:02:26.62,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,I-Inamicul?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.12,0:02:31.48,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,A downloadable extra for Lord Oba Nobunaga's Ambition:
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.13,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,„Strigăte-le de luptă!”
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.44,0:02:35.83,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Are o întreagă armată \Nîn acea cutie mică?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.83,0:02:38.51,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,E-E cumva un vrăjitor?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.51,0:02:40.10,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Suprins?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.76,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,În acest caz...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.43,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Am uitat să-l încarc!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.43,0:02:49.06,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,Go! Kill them both!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.65,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Game over already?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.65,0:02:58.78,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I can protect her...{\i0}{But if it's for this girl's sake...}
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.47,0:03:05.33,Dialogue,Soldier,0,0,0,,No! It's Onishibata!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.33,0:03:09.58,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,Damn! We almost got Oda's general!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.58,0:03:10.68,Dialogue,Soldier2,0,0,0,,Withdraw!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.82,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Oda's general?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.82,0:03:14.84,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Are you unharmed?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.39,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.39,0:03:18.93,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Keep pressing forward and rout the Imagawa.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.26,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.18,0:03:25.23,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Get off of me already!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.66,0:03:32.60,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,How despicable for a mere foot soldier\N to push down the head of the Oda family.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.60,0:03:35.46,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,The head of the family is Oda Nobunaga.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.46,0:03:36.61,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Who's Nobunaga?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.16,0:03:40.24,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} the head of the Oda family,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.32,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.31,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,This is the Sengoku Era.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.31,0:05:21.63,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The land is divided between powerful warlords,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.88,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,who ceaselessly fight amongst themselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.52,0:05:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any internal power struggle is an \Ninvitation for your neighbors to attack.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thus, it was decided that the firstborn child,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,regardless of gender, would \Nbecome the head of the family.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.51,0:05:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q}The result of this was the birth \Nof the Princess Generals.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.34,0:05:45.24,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.24,0:05:47.24,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} Katsuie?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.02,0:05:50.26,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The fierce Shibata Katsuie.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.59,0:05:53.29,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Her nickname is Riku.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Do you have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.50,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.91,0:06:02.92,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Katsuie I know from my \Ngames is a bearded old man.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.12,0:06:07.67,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Stop staring at my breasts!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.67,0:06:08.94,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.76,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,They're just so big, so...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,H-How impudent!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.06,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.26,0:06:17.06,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,If nothing else, he saved my life.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.07,0:06:23.82,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I still can't believe Oda Nobunaga is a girl.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.64,0:06:36.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I understand that the strange \Ntechnique you used isn't magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.83,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is it some kind of barbarian technology?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.83,0:06:39.86,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Technique?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.08,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Oh, the ringtone?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.41,0:06:45.50,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,The battery died, so I can't use it anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.50,0:06:47.06,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.68,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,And here I thought you \Nmight be kind of interesting.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.68,0:06:51.50,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.26,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,You want to serve the Oda family?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Please, Lord Nobunaga{-sama}, let—
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.39,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.39,0:07:02.60,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,You messed up the name of the \Ngeneral you want to serve?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.48,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.48,0:07:07.40,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I told you, my name is {\i1}Nobuna{\i0}!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.55,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,So, what's {\i1}your{\i0} name?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.11,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Give me your name!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.11,0:07:13.62,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I hate the slow-witted!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.62,0:07:15.12,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Come on! Spit it out!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sagara Yoshiharu!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.24,0:07:20.21,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Got it. It's Monkey.{TL note for saru?}
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.03,0:07:22.86,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,It's Sagara Yoshiharu!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.79,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'm from the future,\Nso I'm practically a god—
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.30,0:07:28.65,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,The future?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.80,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I don't believe in gods or buddhas.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.80,0:07:34.21,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,And no human would say something so weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.21,0:07:35.55,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That means you're a monkey.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.55,0:07:38.31,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,Then, we can call him Monkey.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.31,0:07:42.31,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,{\q3}But if we're going to use him as a retainer, he'll need some sort of role.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.19,0:07:44.54,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Niwa Nagahide.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.20,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Her nickname is Manchiyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.59,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The Oda family's tactician.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.15,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.72,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,It felt good to step on him.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.72,0:07:54.20,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,He can be in charge of my shoes.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.83,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,That will do nicely.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.83,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,Seventy points.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.68,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,And why's that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.33,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'm a monkey and in charge of your shoes?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.79,0:08:08.15,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does her calling me "Monkey" mean \NI'm supposed to take his place?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.15,0:08:12.38,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1\t(2549,0,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}The same name Nobunaga gave Toyotomi \NHideyoshi, the man who united Japan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.31,0:08:23.54,Dialogue,Im,0,0,0,,So, you failed to slay that idiot, Oda?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.48,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Imagawa Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.28,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Ruler of the eastern coastal provinces,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.28,0:08:31.72,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,and the countess closest to conquering Japan.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.44,Dialogue,M,0,0,0,,I-I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.83,Dialogue,M,0,0,0,,We almost had her, and then, somebody interfered.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.03,0:08:41.73,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Matsudaira Motoyasu.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.33,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Later, she will become Tokugawa Ieyasu,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.88,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,but currently, she is a mere \Nservant to the Imagawa family.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.34,0:08:52.18,Dialogue,Im,0,0,0,,As punishment, I'll have \Nto cut your pay again!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.41,Dialogue,M,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.41,0:08:59.72,Dialogue,M,0,0,0,,I'm already eating nothing but \Npotatoes four days a week.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.68,0:09:04.98,Dialogue,Im,0,0,0,,Is that you, Hanzou?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.48,0:09:09.61,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,The interference came from \Na man the Oda call "Monkey."
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.46,0:09:13.36,Dialogue,Im,0,0,0,,So, she's taken in a monkey?{Of all things, to hire a monkey...}
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.86,Dialogue,Im,0,0,0,,Nobuna is such a fool!{Nobuna really is a fool}
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.43,0:09:19.87,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,This is kind of shabby.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.20,0:09:23.25,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,"Be grateful that you were \Neven given a place to stay,"
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.57,0:09:25.04,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,is what the princess says.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.00,0:09:27.44,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Maeda Toshiie.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.44,0:09:29.01,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Her nickname is Inuchiyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.01,0:09:32.57,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,The greatest spear wielder in the Oda clan.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.74,0:09:37.41,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I was thrown into the Sengoku Era with nothing of my own,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.41,0:09:39.90,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,so I can't really ask for much.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:39.90,0:09:42.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Is it not to your taste?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.10,0:09:44.07,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Old man Asano.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.07,0:09:47.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh, my. How valiant you look.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.86,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You look much like I did in my youth.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:50.37,0:09:54.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So much so that I wish you'd marry \Nmy daughter Nene and take over my inn.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.72,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Introduce me!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.99,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:59.62,0:10:00.89,Dialogue,Ne,0,0,0,,I'm Nene!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.89,0:10:03.12,Dialogue,Ne,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Mr. Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.63,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,She's way too young! No, thanks!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.63,0:10:07.85,Dialogue,Ne,0,0,0,,You're a very noisy person, Mr. Monkey.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.85,0:10:08.50,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'm not a monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.74,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'm Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.50,Dialogue,Ne,0,0,0,,I understand, Mr. Monkey.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.50,0:10:14.76,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.79,0:10:17.67,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Intruder!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.43,Dialogue,T,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.35,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.19,0:10:40.59,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,My name is Hachisuka Goemon.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.59,0:10:46.45,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I've come to serve you in \Nplace of my master, Kinoshita.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.26,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Another little girl?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.26,0:10:50.45,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.45,0:10:53.21,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I'm not good with long sentences.{Feels like there is a joke missing here}
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.96,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Are you Toukichirou's daughter?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.70,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,His companion!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.70,0:11:04.80,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,He is the trunk, and I am \Nthe vine hiding in its shade.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.80,0:11:07.72,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Together, we will make\Nour way in the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.97,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,That was our promise.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.20,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,So you can do, like, thirty or so letters, tops.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.20,0:11:14.36,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.08,0:11:18.99,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,A promise you made with Tokichirou, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.78,0:11:24.24,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}With no idea of how to get home,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.10,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll have to survive here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.58,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}It sucks that it's not Nobunaga,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.58,0:11:32.04,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}just some snippy little girl named Nobuna,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.04,0:11:35.82,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}but saving a pretty girl and conquering Japan doesn't sound so bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.11,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Just wait, old man.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.11,0:11:42.29,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll live your dream!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:50.15,0:11:53.49,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu plans on attacking Oda.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.02,0:11:56.08,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,He's still young.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.31,0:12:00.23,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Saitou Dousan, the count of Mino.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.23,0:12:02.03,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,A legend of the Sengoku Era,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.03,0:12:06.28,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,who began as a merchant and\Ngrew to rule an entire province.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.28,0:12:09.21,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Nobuhide, the Tiger of Owari Province, has died.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.21,0:12:11.63,Dialogue,?,0,0,0,,And the one who rose in his place...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.60,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,...is a foolish girl with a taste for barbarian fashions.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.60,0:12:17.88,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Normally, she would make an excellent target.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:17.88,0:12:24.13,Dialogue,Retainer,0,0,0,,Indeed. If you leave it to us and Yoshitatsu, we shall destroy her immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.68,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I would take the opposite \Napproach, and befriend her.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.68,0:12:28.97,Dialogue,?,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.96,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,To do what others would never consider.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.96,0:12:36.71,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,That's what it takes to conquer the land.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.15,0:12:42.59,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,The Viper of Mino Province \Nhas requested an audience.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.59,0:12:44.91,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,The Viper? You mean Saitou Dousan?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.93,0:12:47.78,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Scripted event time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.78,0:12:51.31,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,But Mino Province is a rival of ours.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.31,0:12:52.91,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It's not surprising.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.44,0:12:55.17,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,Wh-Why is that?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.17,0:12:59.21,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Because if I were going to ally with \Nsomebody, it would be the Viper.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.90,0:13:07.67,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You didn't believe I was \Nfrom the future, did you?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.67,0:13:08.91,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.60,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'll prove it.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.59,0:13:14.85,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You'll be meeting with Saitou \NDousan at Shoutokuji Temple.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.35,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.35,0:13:19.44,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,We haven't decided where \Nwe're going to meet yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.36,Dialogue,Ninja,0,0,0,,Reporting.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.95,0:13:24.24,Dialogue,Ninja,0,0,0,,Mino Province just gave us the \Nlocation of the conference.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.83,0:13:25.70,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Wh-Where is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.02,0:13:28.70,Dialogue,Ninja,0,0,0,,Shoutokuji Temple, I'm told.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.53,0:13:30.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.29,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.29,0:13:33.37,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,Ninety points.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.75,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Monkey, how did you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.75,0:13:40.63,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,How much time do you think I spent playing the game Lord Oda Nobunaga's Ambition?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.63,0:13:43.88,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,The meeting at Shoutokuji \Nis a mega-famous event in it.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.68,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,M-Mega... eve...?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.68,0:13:48.34,Dialogue,Ni,0,0,0,,Is that some barbarian language?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.34,0:13:49.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The Monkey language.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.75,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You brought a lot of them.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.27,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,500 riflemen. Pretty impressive, aren't they?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.74,0:14:03.28,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I brought them to show off to the Viper.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.37,0:14:08.28,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, Dousan sees \NNobunaga heading to the meeting, and...{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.53,Dialogue,Ak,0,0,0,,If we kill Nobuna here,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.53,0:14:14.07,Dialogue,Ak,0,0,0,,Owari Province will belong \Nto the Saitou family.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.61,0:14:19.51,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Akechi Juubei Mitsuhide, famous \Nfor her literary and military talent.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.51,0:14:23.30,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,A young genius who has \Nbegun to distinguish herself.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.72,0:14:26.56,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Do you think it will be that easy?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.56,0:14:27.71,Dialogue,Ak,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.29,Dialogue,Ak,0,0,0,,Everything is ready.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.59,0:14:34.43,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobuna!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.23,0:14:36.43,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,You address your lord like that?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.99,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Whatever! Have your men light their rifles!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.99,0:14:40.52,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,What if the rifles explode?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.90,0:14:43.64,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Are your men that inept?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.09,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.09,0:14:45.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.45,Dialogue,Ak,0,0,0,,We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Impossible!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.34,0:14:55.99,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.99,0:14:59.56,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,She had the rifles lit despite the \Nfact that they might explode.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.56,0:15:03.83,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,She's either a complete fool, or...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.88,0:15:09.75,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,She's late.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.81,0:15:15.39,Dialogue,Ak,0,0,0,,Lord Dousan{-sama}, you really shouldn't dress \Nlike that during an important meeting.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.33,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,She'll do the same.{She dressed in an equally casual manner.}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.89,0:15:22.15,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Making the other person feel at \Nease is part of being a great leader.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.15,0:15:24.46,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}So he {\i0}was{\i1} watching.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.46,0:15:29.40,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anyway, that girl next to him is so cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.75,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I've kept you waiting, Viper.{Kept you waiting, haven't I? Viper.}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.06,0:15:43.00,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.25,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.99,0:15:47.38,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.38,0:15:51.60,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I mean, you're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.52,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Did I surprise you?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.09,0:15:59.23,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.68,0:16:02.03,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:02.03,0:16:04.19,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's stunning!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.54,0:16:06.91,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Why did you change your clothes?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.91,0:16:08.91,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'm meeting the Viper of Mino.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.19,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be right to wear my usual clothes.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.41,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.82,0:16:15.91,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,{\i1}These two...{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.41,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dousan tried to make Nobuna feel at ease,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.90,0:16:22.41,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Nobuna showed respect for Dousan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.18,0:16:27.42,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,You seem to have brought a lot of riflemen.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.42,0:16:30.07,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Now is the age of the rifle.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.07,0:16:33.57,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Many say they're barbarian toys.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.57,0:16:39.50,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Anyone foolish enough to say such a thing would \Nbe downed in a single shot by my foot soldiers.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.65,0:16:44.19,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,The Owari Province soldiers are \Nsaid to be the weakest in Japan,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.19,0:16:46.94,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,but with rifles in their hands,\Nthey're the strongest.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.30,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someday, those rifles will destroy{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.30,0:16:55.73,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}the strongest cavalry of the \NSengoku Era: Takeda's cavalry!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.14,0:17:00.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man, I'm so excited that I'm shaking!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.45,0:17:02.99,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,After you've allied with me,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.99,0:17:05.97,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,will you attack Suruga Province and Imagawa?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.59,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,No. Mino.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.01,0:17:14.18,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Why focus on Mino Province?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.87,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,The same reason you did, Viper.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.20,0:17:21.60,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,The one who rules Mino \NProvince rules the nation.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.21,0:17:25.60,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It's the center of Japan,\Ndividing the east and west.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.20,0:17:30.86,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Build a well-constructed castle here, \Nand the nation is as good as yours.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.99,0:17:35.98,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,To make a wealthy country, \Nwhere merchants travel freely.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.13,0:17:40.12,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That was your ambition, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.47,0:17:43.79,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,So you know all about it?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.00,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'm taking Mino Province.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.84,0:17:57.25,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll let you?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.25,0:17:59.80,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,What if I told you that I will carry on your dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.55,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.18,0:18:06.05,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I'll destroy the old systems that \Nhave wrought havoc across Japan,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.05,0:18:09.56,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,and turn this into a country that can \Ncompete with the barbarian nations.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.76,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I've set my sights on the whole world!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.97,0:18:23.54,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You're a little brat,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.54,0:18:25.83,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,but I'd be fine with you \Nconquering all of Japan!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.89,0:18:32.29,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,{\t(3640,0,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}So your gaze already lies beyond the sea?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.92,0:18:36.20,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Your ideals are correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.20,0:18:38.40,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,But no one can follow you there.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.97,0:18:42.22,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,The fact that they call \Nyou a fool is proof of that.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.98,0:18:45.95,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Even so, I'll keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:45.95,0:18:49.89,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Destroying anything that gets in your way?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.74,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,If you wish to start with Mino,\Nthen I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.57,0:18:59.24,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.53,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Wait just a second!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.35,0:19:06.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Do you want to be killed?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:06.88,0:19:07.83,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Get back, Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.54,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Saitou Dousan!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.58,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.58,0:19:15.29,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,You know what lies in store for Mino. \NStop being so stubborn!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.81,0:19:17.34,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.34,0:19:18.80,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,This will be entertaining.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.34,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Let him speak.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.34,0:19:21.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.79,0:19:23.06,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.13,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Let me do this.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.98,0:19:41.86,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,One wrong word and your \Nhead will be lying on the floor.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.07,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Apologize, Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.07,0:19:43.87,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.87,0:19:47.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Dousan, when this meeting is \Nover, you'll tell your men this:
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.54,0:19:52.62,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,"My children shall tie their horses \Nat the gate of The Fool of Owari."
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.62,0:19:54.62,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.20,0:19:58.46,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,In other words, you already know \Nyour son can't defeat Nobuna.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.46,0:20:00.13,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,You know it can't happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:11.03,0:20:14.54,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Child, how did you know what I was thinking?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:15.33,0:20:17.47,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I just knew, is all.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.47,0:20:18.36,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.10,0:20:21.36,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'm from the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.51,0:20:25.77,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You're going to hand Mino over to Nobuna.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.77,0:20:29.58,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,If you don't, your entire \Nlife will have been a waste.{Since if you don't, your entire life would be wasted.}
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.38,0:20:34.58,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Saitou Dousan, Oda Nobuna is the only\None who can continue your dream!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.86,0:20:38.59,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Child...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.97,0:20:45.56,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I have completely lost.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.48,0:20:47.47,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Viper?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.47,0:20:51.72,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I didn't expect anyone from the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.72,0:20:54.19,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,450 years in the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.19,0:20:58.28,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,There, Saitou Dousan is a \Nhero of the Sengoku Era.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.46,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.46,0:21:04.26,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I wrote my name in the \Nannals of history, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.65,0:21:12.91,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, the Viper has become \Ntrue to himself at the very end.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.87,0:21:19.13,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I will prepare a treaty handing Mino Province over to little miss Nobuna.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.66,0:21:25.43,Dialogue,Sa,0,0,0,,I will give Mino to my new daughter, Nobuna!{I will relinquish Mino to you and Nobuna!}
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.46,0:21:28.67,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:31.74,0:21:37.48,Dialogue,Narr,0,0,0,,Thus, the Owari and Mino \NProvinces formed an alliance.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.88,0:21:39.98,Dialogue,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad, Father?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.98,0:21:42.90,Dialogue,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept it!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.65,0:21:46.20,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I guess I'll praise you for this.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.12,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.36,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Say it to my face.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.36,0:21:51.58,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Shut up, already!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:51.58,0:21:53.61,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Just give me my shoes.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.61,0:21:54.66,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,We're leaving!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.66,0:21:56.15,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Oh, these?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.29,0:21:59.79,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Why were you keeping them there?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.14,0:22:01.54,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,It's a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.87,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want them to be \Ncold when you put them on!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.87,0:22:07.55,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,You were getting off on the \Nsmell of my feet, weren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.55,0:22:10.55,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Nu am văzut niciodată \Nun asemenea pervers!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.06,0:22:13.03,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Simplul fapt că respiri \Nreprezintă un păcat.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.03,0:22:14.56,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Te voi ucide chiar acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.36,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Maimuță perversă!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.36,0:22:18.30,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Sper că ești pregătit!
